{"title": "Ray of Frost", "pageid": 1691, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ray_of_Frost", "categories": ["Spells", "Cantrips", "Evocation spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions", "Sources of Cold damage", "Cold Damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the equivalent <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Four_Elements\" title=\"Way of the Four Elements\">Way of the Four Elements</a> Monk spell, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chill_of_the_Mountain\" title=\"Chill of the Mountain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/38px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/50px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chill of the Mountain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Ray_of_Frost_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chill_of_the_Mountain\" title=\"Chill of the Mountain\">Chill of the Mountain</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ray_of_Frost.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Ray_of_Frost.webp/300px-Ray_of_Frost.webp, /w/images/1/13/Ray_of_Frost.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Ray_of_Frost.webp/300px-Ray_of_Frost.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Ray_of_Frost.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Ray of Frost </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">cantrip (Evocation)</a>. It deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage to the target and slows it down.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nReduces the target's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> by 3 m (10 ft).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~8</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/D8_Cold.png/26px-D8_Cold.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/D8_Cold.png/40px-D8_Cold.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/D8_Cold.png/53px-D8_Cold.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/D8_Cold.png/26px-D8_Cold.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/D8_Cold.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">1d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<ul><li>At <a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">character level</a> 5, the damage increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>.</li>\n<li>At character level 10, the damage increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Projectile_RayOfFrost</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_RayOfFrost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Projectile_RayOfFrost\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ray_of_Frost\"> Condition: Ray of Frost </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Ray of Frost (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ray of Frost\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Ray_of_Frost_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Frost_(Condition)\" title=\"Ray of Frost (Condition)\">Ray of Frost</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is reduced by 3 m (10 ft).</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a></li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>Races: <ul><li> Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/High_Half-Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Half-Elf\">High Half-Elf</a> </li></ul>\n<p>(<i>Character level</i> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)\n</p>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Sniper\" title=\"Spell Sniper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/38px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/50px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Sniper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp/25px-Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Spell_Sniper_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Sniper\" title=\"Spell Sniper\">Spell Sniper</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mourning_Frost\" title=\"Mourning Frost\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Mourning_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mourning_Frost\" title=\"Mourning Frost\">Mourning Frost</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a>  can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Scroll of Ray of Frost\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Frost\" title=\"Scroll of Ray of Frost\">Scroll of Ray of Frost</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The High Elf and High Half-Elf racial versions of this cantrip are from the <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a> spell list and use <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> as the spellcasting ability, regardless of the character's class.</li>\n<li>Casting this spell at a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_(surface)\" title=\"Fire (surface)\">Fire</a> surface extinguishes it. It also extinguishes other fire objects such as torches, braziers, campfires, etc.</li>\n<li>Directly hitting a liquid (water or blood) surface or someone standing on such a surface causes the liquid surface to freeze, immediately forcing all standing on it to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>.</li>\n<li>Casting this spell on a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> target causes double damage due to <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerability\">Vulnerability</a>.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Ray of Frost is <b>Glacies</b>, Latin for <i>\"ice.\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/e/eb/Ray_of_Frost_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Ray_of_Frost_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Ray_of_Frost_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ray_of_frost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Ico